								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=912.msg10466#msg10466">Re: (No topic kinda pointless yet redundant topic)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #18 on:</b> August 26, 2004, 03:08:32 am &#187;</span></td>
