							I&#039;ve never heard that.&nbsp; All our shows are rated.&nbsp; And some of our court cases have publicity bans so they&#039;re not in the news whatsoever.<br /><br />I&#039;ll do a little more research into it tho.&nbsp; We get all the same news and shows you guys do.
