							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							Recently I went to a family reunion and it was very pleasant. I took my 7 month daughter so everyone could meet the new addition. Okay okay I am coming to my point. I overheard my mom and some of my relatives talking to a 2nd or 3rd cousin about politcs.&nbsp; This women was a supporter of John Kerry and she explained took part in the John Kerry Campain.&nbsp; She I jumped in cause I LOVE talking politics.&nbsp; This women was soooo utterly crazy that she didnt make sence. She was saying that George Junior in Iraq because George Senior failed to get Saddam out of Power.&nbsp; She then said George Junior wanted revenge on Saddam for the attempted assasination of George Senior.&nbsp; Needless to say she said that she in the army at some point and she said she would never volunteer for service again. Huh some patriot huh...&nbsp; After your rambling on for a a couple of minutes my mom and my sane relatives left me alone with my CRAZY RELATIVE JOHN KERRY SUPPORTER... OMG!!&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" /> So she fires on me saying who am I going to vote for I said I was indecided so she askes me what I feel about John Kerry. I said he was to liberal for me because of the abortion issue and John Kerry doesnt make sence he changes his mind and doesnt make sence. She voiced her opinion about abortion saying my daughter was a virus and that if I voted for George Bush that I would cause the death of my daughter..&nbsp; &nbsp;<img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Smileys/Rodcet/wtf1.gif" alt="WTF" border="0" />&nbsp; So coming to my whole point about liberals and John Kerry,&nbsp; why would I vote for John Kerry when he has a supporter like this crazy women.<br />So I am telling you all that I am going to vote for Bush because John Kerry lacks intergrity and is a liar and proof of that is that he lied during the Vietnam hearing.&nbsp; He said he was responsible for atrocities in Vietnam and I dont want someone bragging about his purple hearts and bragging of what he did in that war. I do know who i want for President and that is George Bush.. If Rudy Giorloni the formor Mayor was running I would vote for him and not Kerry or Bush.. But alas that wont happen..&nbsp; sorry so long but frankly my nutty relative telling me that my daughter is a virus, she was an asshole<br /><br />Colleen Quickness<br />65 ranger
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
						<td valign="bottom" class="smalltext">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" colspan="2" class="smalltext">
								</td>
							</tr><tr>
